{
  "bookId": "hero-212105",
  "id": "bond-28516",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28516001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "迪卡獨自面對那些怪獸的時候，有害怕過嗎？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28516002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28516003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "看這個回答的氣勢，應該是沒有？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28516004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "真是令人驚嘆的勇氣啊，話說我以前也幻想過很多次自己變成超人力霸王，並與那些怪獸戰鬥的樣子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28516005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "現在想想，要是我變成超人力霸王，和那些怪獸戰鬥的話——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28516006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不用十秒，不，甚至不用五秒，那些怪物就會跪在我的面前！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28516007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28516008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……搖著我的肩膀求我不要死。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28516009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰？？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28516010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "哈哈，只是開個小玩笑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28516011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "「沒有勝算？我聽不懂。」——我也應該拿出和迪卡一樣的人生態度才行啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28516012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "無論面對什麼樣的困難和敵人，都不能輕易認輸。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
